  "audio": null,
  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.41-V2). Two hardware revisions with different pins; this is V2 (a Rev2.0 silkscreen on the PCB, or a V2 QC label on a cased one). V1 has the panel reset on GPIO21 and the touch reset on GPIO3, where V2 has both on the expander and uses GPIO3 for the touch interrupt and GPIO21 for the panel's TE. The vendor's Arduino example also makes EXIO5 an output; it is a free header pin on the schematic and the GPIO test toggles it. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
